# Deep2 Qwen32 40TPS — Batch 2/5, item 9
# Base: apply after 0006-0008.
# Goal: stop creating two std::async worker tasks for every GEMV.
#
# A dense 64-layer token performs hundreds of matrix multiplies. Repeated
# task/thread creation becomes measurable even after GPU kernels are fast.
# Keep two workers alive for the process and wake them for each row split.
#
# Apply:
#   git -C F:\~dev apply --3way 0009_persistent_dual_rowsplit_executor.patch

